  "question": {
    "text": "A <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> mass of nitrogen gas is enclosed in a vessel at a temperature,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>27</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>.&nbsp;The amount of heat transferred to the gas, so that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>.</mo></math> velocity of molecules is doubled, is about.<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.3</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>mole</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>"
